{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわっ(#^.^#) ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいい天気でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは、どんな一日中を過ごしましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の方、学校の方、お疲れさま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は  今日、レッスンやら撮影やら\nなんやらかんやらしておりまして (笑)\n合間に、メンバーとふざけあったりして\nめっちゃ楽しかったです（ミ＾o＾ミ）♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに、まいやんとななみんと\nカメラで変な写真いっぱい撮って遊んで\nめっちゃ面白かった！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこりほっこり＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊ぼうねー(*^o^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、このまえね、\n髪型を アレンジしてみたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両サイドから編み込んで、後ろでまとめてみたら\nメンバーのみんなに上手～って褒められたの(#^.^#)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな～＾＾？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし、細かい作業がすごく好きなんです(*´ω`*)えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はすっごい器用だよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お裁縫セットを持ち歩いているよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのボタンが取れたらすぐ\n縫ってあげるからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅぱぱぱぱっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、グラタンのチーズの焦げ焦げも\n少しずつ、カリカリしながら\n全部 キレイになるまで食べるのが好きっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだ～ 細かいだろ～ (๑•ૅω•´๑)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、いい夢みてくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/20/5835613/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyanヽ(｡･ω･｡)"}